. Wait for 2 seconds","35. Assert: Verify Data Grid cell for first row - Captured Credit Note caption contains the value of first row data grid of Credit Note #"]','IMS login page loads successfully in the browser with Username field, Password field, and Login button visible.  Username and password are accepted in their fields; password is masked with dots/asterisks. No validation errors appear. User is authenticated and redirected to the Home page. Left navigation menu, header are displayed. Order page loads; Order grid/list is displayed with toolbar (Create New Order button, filters, etc.). Grid columns are verified and present in the exact order: S/O, S/O NO $, Order #, Customer Name, Project Name, Customer PO #, User Comments, Vendor PO #, Deposit, Salesman, Order Date, Last Shipped Date, Currency, Status. Create New Order form/page opens; empty order form is displayed with required fields. Supplier Party Id value is entered in the Find Bill Address field. Find dialog/modal opens displaying a grid of suppliers matching the entered Party Id. All rows in the "Company Name" column match the Supplier Party Id criteria - assertion passes. Visible row count >= 1 - assertion passes (at least one matching supplier is displayed). Add button is clicked; selected supplier is added as Bill Address; modal closes; supplier details populate in the order form. Product search dialog/modal opens for Enter Product Id field. After 2-second wait, Search button is clicked; product grid loads with results. First product where Stock on S/O (PCS) = 0 AND Actual Yard Stock (PCS) > 0 is identified and captured (product details stored in variable). Checkbox of the captured product is selected (checked state = true). Add Products button is clicked; product is added to the order line items; modal closes. After 2-sec wait, Save button is clicked; order is saved successfully; success toast/message displayed; page refreshes to Edit Order view. Order # is captured from the caption near "Edit Ord