(37790,NULL,103,1106,5518,'Optimized','TC_35: Validate Welding BOM creation and edit','["1.Launch and navigate to the IMS login page using url","2. Enter valid username","3. Enter valid password","4. Click on the ‘Login’ button","5. Click on Expand button in left MuiBox","6. Click on Inventory","7. Click on Welding BOM","8. Assert: Verify Welding BOM text is displayed","9. Click create welding BOM","10. Enter valid SO","11. Select Product type as PIPE","12. Select Location as PPMTL","13. Click search icon beside product to join","14. Enter OD Range From","15. Enter OD Range To","16. Enter WallT Range From","17. Enter WallT Range To","18. Click Search","19. Assert: The visible row count is ≥ 1","20. Select two pipe from the list where Actual Yard Stock>=1 and Stock on S/O=0","21. Click Add Products","22. Enter Project Quantity as 5","23. Click on Save","24. Click on OK button on the popup","25. Assert: New Length is sum of Length both the product added in Welding","26. Click on Start Production button","27. Click on OK button on the popup","28. Fetch the Welding Detail BOM #","29. Fetch the New Product ID","30. Assert: Print Welding BOM button is visible","31. Assert: Print Welding BOM button is enabled","32. Click on Print Welding BOM button","33. Assert: Verify pdf should be generated on click.","34. Click on cross icon to close the Welding Detail BOM screen","35. Click on Inventory History","36. Enter New Product ID in Product","37. Click on Search","38. Assert: The visible row count is ≥ 1","39. Assert: Verify Details column have BOM #","40. Assert: Qty Incr.(+ Pcs)=1"]','User should be able to login in the application. Welding BOM screen should be displayed. BOM should be created and new length should be sum of length of both pipe. New length inventory should be added by welding BOM and BOM should be shown as Processed on Welding BOM listing screen and print welding BOM button and pdf should be print on click. Verify pdf should be generated on click.','["url: https://ims.sws.pipe-piling.com/auth/ims/login","username: Krishna","password: ofbiz","Product Type: PIPE","SO:MTL15526","Location: PPMTL","OD Range From:24.000","OD Range To:24.000","WallT Range From:0.188","WallT Range To:0.188","Project Quantity: 5"]','2026-04-28 14:28:41','2026-05-11 13:30:41',1,'P1','["functional", "boundary", "regression"]',1,0),
(37791,NULL,103,1106,5519,'Optimized','TC_30: Validate MTR document is linked with the coil received','["Launch and navigate to the IMS login page using url","Enter valid username","Enter valid password","Click on the ‘Login’ button","Click on Expand button in left MuiBox","Click on Inventory","Click on Search Inventory","Assert: Verify Search Inventory text is displayed","Select product type as Coils","Enter Serial Number","Click on Search","Assert: The visible row count is ≥ 1","Assert: MTR for the search coil should be displayed as \\"Y\\""]','User should be able to login in the application and Welcome page should be displayed. Search Inventory screen should be displayed. Product type should be updated to Coils. System should filter the entered coil on the result. MTR for the search coil should be displayed as "Y"','["url: https://ims.sws.pipe-piling.com/auth/ims/login","username: Krishna","password: ofbiz","Serial Number:4"]','2026-04-28 14:28:41','2026-05-11 13:36:45',1,'P1','["Functional", "Smoke", "Integration"]',1,0),
(37792,NULL,103,1106,5519,'Optimized','TC_28: Validate MTR document upload against the Generic coil','["Launch and navigate to the IMS login page using url","Enter valid username","Enter valid password","Click on the ‘Login’ button","Click on Expand button in left MuiBox","Click on Intransit","Click on Receive Transit","Assert: Verify Receive Transit text is displayed","Click on edit icon on first item in the receive transit listing","Assert: Verify Receive Transit page is displayed","Click on the Linked document icon on the first item in the list to open upload document screen","Assert: Upload Document page is displayed","Select the document type as MTR","Enter the Coil # both unique serial number with comma separated","Enter the Heat #","Click Choose File to choose the document from the system and pick pdf document from the system folder","Assert: Upload button is visible and clickable","Click on Upload button","Assert: Document is uploaded","Close the upload document overlap","Assert: Upload Document overlay is closed","Click on the Attachment button on top right to check if the document uploaded are showing","Assert: PO Intransit Receive Documents screen is displayed","Assert: The visible row count is ≥ 2","Assert: Both the rows have Document Type MTR","Assert: Both the rows have same Heat#"]','User should be able to login in the application and Welcome page should be displayed. Receive Transit page should be displayed. Receive Purchase Order Intransit overlay should be displayed. Upload document overlay should be opened with Product id, strip width, wallt, transit id, Container#, vessel name details prefilled. Heat# and coil# field should be updated. Document should be uploaded and overlay should be opened again but with blank heat# field. Upload Document overlay should close. In transit document screen should be displayed and should list both the rows with document type as MTR and same heat# across both the rows','["url: https://ims.sws.pipe-piling.com/auth/ims/login","username: Krishna","password: ofbiz","PO#:083743322","Coil #:PP7823,AA8283","Heat#:WQ9921","Vendor Coil#:PP7823,AA8283"]','2026-04-28 14:28:41','2026-05-11 13:37:14',1,'P1','["Validation", "Functional", "Regression"]',1,0),
(37793,NULL,103,1106,5519,'Optimized','TC_29: Validate PO In transit receiving of the generic coil','["1. Launch and navigate to the IMS login page using url","2. Enter valid username","3. Enter valid password","4. Click on the ‘Login’ button","5. Click on Expand button in left MuiBox","6. Click on Intransit","7. Click on Receive Transit","8. Assert: Verify Receive Transit text is displayed","9. Select Transit ID and click on edit button","10. Assert: Receive All button should be visible","11. Click Receive all button","12. Assert: Receive button should be visible","13. Click Receive button to receive In transit","14. Assert: Print button should be displayed on the top After the receive","15. Click on Purchase Order Menu","16. Assert: Purchase order screen should be displayed","17. Enter PO #","18. Click on search","19. Assert: The visible row count is ≥ 1","20. Click on edit button","21. Assert: Purchase Order Edit screen should display","22. Assert:  T/PO Qty Intransit value is updated to 0","23. Assert: PO Qty Received value is equal to T/PO Qty Shipped","24. Assert: Shipment Summary button is visible and enabled","25. Click on Shipmnet Summary Button on PO screen","26. Assert: Total Qty Received value is equal to PO Qty Received value"]','User should be able to login in the application and Welcome page should be displayed. Receive In transit list screen should be displayed. Receive screen for PO in transit should be displayed with text \'Receive Purchase Order In Transit\' on top. Print button should be displayed on the top After the receive. \'Purchase Order Edit screen should display. Qty In transit should be updated to 0 and Qty received updated as per the PO In transit qty and qty shipped should match the Qty received. Qty Received on Shipment summary should match the Qty received on PO screen','["url: https://ims.sws.pipe-piling.com/auth/ims/login","username: Krishna","password: ofbiz","Transit ID: 217007","PO#: 18088-AA"]','2026-04-28 14:28:42','2026-05-11 13:38:09',1,'P1','["Financial", "Critical", "Integration"]',1,0),
