(37795,NULL,103,1106,5520,'Optimized','TC_32: Validate Freight Invoice screen for Warehouse shipment and check inventory adjustment is posted','["1. Launch and navigate to the IMS login page using url","2. Enter valid username","3. Enter valid password","4. Click on the ‘Login’ button","5. Click on Expand button in left MuiBox","6. Click on Invoice","7. Click on Freight Shipment","8. Assert: Verify  Freight Shipment text is displayed","9. Enter the BOL #","10. Click search button","11. Assert: The visible row count is ≥ 1","12. Select the shipment from the checkbox on the left","13. Assert: Generate Freight Invoice button is enabled","14. Click Generate Freight Invoice","15. Click on Shipping Carrier dropdown","16. Enter shipping carrier as PRC and select PRC100 - PRC TRUCKING LTD","17. Enter Freight Invoice #","18. Enter Freight Rate (Pre-Tax)","19. Assert: Post freight Invoice button is enabled","20. Click on Post freight Invoice button","21. Click on Ok on confirm popup","22. Close generate freight invoice screen","23. Assert: Verify Freight Shipment page is displayed","24. Click on Invoice","25. Click on Freight Invoices screen","26. Assert: Verify  Freight Invoices text is displayed","27. Enter Freight Invoice #","28. Click on Search","29. Assert: The visible row count is ≥ 1","30. Assert: Verify Freight Invoice Status is \'Created\'","31. Assert: Shipping Carrier should be \'PRC TRUCKI - PRC TRUCKING LTD\'","32. Assert: Freight Invoice Date","33. Click on Edit button","34. Assert: Edit Freight Invoice screen is displayed","35. Assert: GL Expense Code field is visible and have some value","36. Assert: Shipping Carrier should be \'PRC100 - PRC TRUCKING LTD\'","37. Assert: Freight Invoice id should be 9884334","38. Freight rate Pre tax should be 600","39. Total should be 600.00","40. Click on Inventory","41. Click on Inventory History","42. Assert: Inventory History text is displayed","43. Enter Product ID","44. Select Location as ECLIPS","45. Click on search","46. Assert: The visible row count is ≥ 1","47. Assert: Shipment value is equal to BOL#"]','User should be able to login in the application and Welcome page should be displayed. \'Freight Shipment screen should be displayed. Selected shipment should be filtered on the screen. Generate Freight Invoice screen should be opened. \'Freight  Invoice should be displayed and details should be displayed on the invoice screen. Freight Invoice status should be created. Shipping Carrier should be \'PRC TRUCKI - PRC TRUCKING LTD\'. \'Edit Invoice screen should be displayed and all the required details should be displayed. GL Expense Code should be 55800. Shipping Carrier should be \'PRC100 - PRC TRUCKING LTD\'. Freight Invoice id should be 9884334. Freight rate Pre tax should be 600. Total should be 600.00','["url: https://ims.sws.pipe-piling.com/auth/ims/login","username: Krishna","password: ofbiz","BOL #: 1085613","Intransit ID:217182","Shipping carrier: PRC100 - PRC TRUCKING LTD","Freight Invoice #: 9884334","Freight Rate (Pre-Tax):600","Product ID: 08.00036.0035.00FBPB42","Location: ECLIPS"]','2026-04-28 14:28:42','2026-05-11 13:38:59',1,'P2','["functional", "edge_case", "zero_deposit"]',1,0),
(37796,NULL,103,1106,5520,'Optimized','TC_36: Validate Sales order creation and edit in PPUSA company','["1. Launch and navigate to the IMS login page using url","2. Enter valid username","3. Enter valid password","4. Click on the ‘Login’ button","5. Click on Expand button in left MuiBox","6. Click on Order menu","7. Click on Create New Order button","8. Click on search icon beside the Find Bill Adddress","9. Enter \'Walk\' in Customer ID","10. Click on search","11. Click on Add button","12. Enter PPUSA to PPMTL Purchase order id at Upload PO details input field","13. Click on Add Purchase Order Icon button","14. Assert: PO Details overlay is displayed","15. Click on Add All button","16. Assert: New Sales Order screen is displayed","17. Update Unit Price for the rows as 800","18. Click on Add PO Number","19. Enter PPUSA to PPMTL Purchase order id at PO# input field","20. Click Add PO button","21. Assert: Vendor PO# has PPUSA to PPMTL Purchase order id value","22. Click on Save button","23. Edit order screen is displayed","24. Click on Order Actions button","25. Click on Approve Order button","26. Click on cross icon to close the Edit Order screen","27. Assert: Search Orders screen is displayed","28. Click on Shipping menu","29. Assert: Shipping page is displayed","30. Enter PPUSA to PPMTL Purchase order id in Vendor PO # input field","31. Click on Search Button","32. Assert: The visible row count is ≥ 1","33. Click Edit button","34. Enter Qty to pick as 1 for row 1 and row 2","35. Click on Generate picklist button","36. Click on Generate BOL button","37. Read and capture the BOL # caption near the Manage Shipment header","38. Click on cross icon to close the manage shipment screen","39. Click on Invoice","40. Click on Shipments To Invoice","41. Assert: Shipments To Invoice page is displayed","42. Enter the captured BOL # into the BOL # input field","43. Click on Search","44. Select the checkbox and click on generate invoice button","45. Click on Preview Invoice","46. Click on Ok button on confirm popup","47. Click on Generate Invoice button","48. Click on Invoices ","49. Enter the captured BOL # into BOL # input field","50. Click on Search","51. Click on edit"]','User should be logged as Auburn or Seneca user. New Sales Order screen should be displayed. Item from PPUSA to PMTL PO should be automatically added in Sales order.  \'Sales order should be created and vendor PO should be linked and same should be shown on order edit  and order notes should displayed the message. \'Shipment should be created and Invoice should be generated and validate taxes are shown as per Order screen in the Invoice','["url: https://ims.sws.pipe-piling.com/auth/ims/login","username: TestB","password: ofbiz","PPUSA to PPMTL Purchase order id:30780-USA"]','2026-04-28 14:28:42','2026-05-11 13:39:55',1,'P1','["validation", "financial_rules", "revenue"]',1,0),
(37797,NULL,103,1106,5521,'Optimized','DS_11 & DS_12 : Verify deferred revenue with apply for pro-data based processing. Also verify deferred revenue summary after adding the deferred revenue amount.','["Launch and navigate to IMS login page using URL","Enter valid username","Enter valid password","Click on the ‘Login’ button","Click on Expand button in left MuiBox","Click Edit company icon","Select PPMTL","Wait for 5 seconds","Click on Order menu","Click button to create a new order","Select the Deferred Revenue Appl as \\"Pro Rata Based Processing\\"","Click on search icon beside the Find Bill Address","Enter \'ABM100_PPMTL\' in Customer ID","Click on search","Click on Add button","Click the Find button for the product search field","Wait for 2 seconds","Open product type dropdown","Select product type as BEAMS","Wait for 2 seconds","Click the Search button to execute product search","Select the checkbox of the first product where Stock on S/O equals 0 and Actual Yard Stock is greater than 0","Click the Add Products button to add the selected product","Wait for 2 seconds","Scroll unit price into viewport ","Click on Unit Price","Fill Unit Price with 800","Click outside grid","Wait for 2 seconds","Click the Save button to save the new order","Wait for 5 seconds","Read and capture the Order # caption near the Edit Order header","Wait for 2 seconds","Click on Order Actions Button","Click on Approve Order menu item","Wait for 5 seconds","Click on Order Actions","Click on Add Deferred Revenue menu item","Assert: Add Deferred Revenue overlay should be displayed","Enter Deferred Revenue (Pre-Tax $)","Enter Qty For This Deposit","Click on Preview Payment Invoice button","Assert: Preview For Invoice page is displayed","Read and Capture the Total value","Click on Generate Payment Invoice button","Wait for 5 Seconds","Assert: Edit Order screen is displayed","Read and Capture the Deposit($) field value","Read and Capture the Deposit(%) field value","Assert:Deposit($) have value equal to Captured Total value","Assert:Deposit(%)>0","Click on Actions button","Click on Def Revenue Summary menu item","Assert: Deferred Revenue Summary screen is displayed","Assert: Deferred Revenue (Tax Included) ($) column have value equal to Captured Deposit($) value"]','User should be able to login in the application and Welcome page should be displayed. User should be able to create sales order and able to add deferred revenue amount and able to see that amount on def revenue summary screen','["url: https://ims.sws.pipe-piling.com/auth/ims/login","username: Krishna","password: ofbiz","Customer ID:ABM100_PPMTL","Deferred Revenue (Pre-Tax $): 600","Qty For This Deposit:1"]','2026-04-28 14:28:42','2026-06-05 12:12:13',1,'P1','["functional", "integration", "positive"]',1,0),
