(37829,NULL,103,1108,5533,'Optimized','DSTC_04-Verify search filters are working on order listing screen','["1.Enter the IMS URL on browser.","https://ims.sws.pipe-piling.com/auth/ims/login/","2.Enter the user name and password.","3.Click on Login button.","4 Go to order module.","5. Enter order id and click on filter.","6. Enter customer name and click on filter.","7. Enter or find customer id from find button and click on filter.","8. Enter project name and click on search.","9. Click reset button.","10. Select Deposit checkbox and click search","11 Click reset button and then select order with 999 price checkbox and click search",""]','1. Order window should open. 2. Order should show which contains entered id. 3. Order should show which contains entered customer name. 4. Order should show which contains entered customer id. 5. Order should show which contains entered project name. 6. All entered field should be clear." 7. System should filter out order with deposit only with deposit status as Yes 8 First order screen should be reset to default with deposit checkbox unchecked and then system should filter out the order with 999 price- check edit order and validate','["valid username: Arun1","Valid password: ofbiz"]','2026-05-18 10:15:45','2026-07-25 16:43:03',1,'P1','["functional", "security", "smoke"]',1,0),
(37830,NULL,103,1108,5533,'Optimized','DSTC_05 and 08: Verify order creation & approval. Also verify order cancellation','["Launch the application.","Enter a valid username in the Username field.","Enter a valid password in the Password field.","Click on the Login button.","Click on the Order button from the side navigation menu.","Click on the Create New Order button.","Click on the Find button in the Find Bill Address section.","Click on the Add button from the first row of the address lookup window.","Click on the Find button available next to the Enter Product ID field.","Click on the Search button in the product lookup window.","Select the checkbox for the first product row.","Click on the Add Products button.","Verify that the Quantity Ordered value is displayed as 1.","Verify that the Unit Price is displayed as 999.00.","Verify that the Total Amount is displayed as 3686.31.","Update the Quantity Ordered value by increasing it by 1.","Click on the Save Item button.","Verify that the updated quantity and price values are displayed correctly.","Click on the Save button.","Verify that the product is added successfully to the order."]','The user should be able to successfully create and save a new order with the selected billing address and product details, and the updated quantity and pricing information should be reflected correctly.','["URL - \\"https://ims.sws.pipe-piling.com/auth/ims/login/\\"","username : \\"Arun1\\"","password : \\"ofbiz\\""]','2026-05-18 10:15:45','2026-07-25 16:43:36',1,'P1','["session", "security", "high-risk"]',1,0),
(37831,NULL,103,1108,5533,'Optimized','DSTC - 26 : Verify user is able to generate picklist','["Navigate to the Shipping module from the main menu.","Open the Approved List section.","Select an approved order and click Order for Shipping.","Verify that the Picklist page is displayed successfully.","Enter the required quantity in the Quantity to Pick field.","Click on the Generate Picklist button.","Verify that the picklist is generated with correct order and quantity details.","Click on the Print Picklist button.","Verify that the picklist PDF is generated/downloaded successfully and contains the correct information."]','"1. Shipping page should open. 2. Page should open to generate picklist. 3. Products should show in item list to pick. 4. Quantity should entered and updated. Weight should be updated in weight column. 5. Picklist should be generated and page should redirect to Manage shipment page. 6. At item level quantity shipped should be updated and order balance should be updated with deducted quantity which is picked. 7. PDF should have below content: an) Sold to and Ship to addresses b) Date and order number. c) Company name. d) Order details which need to be pick. e) Picking slip number."','["URL - \\"https://ims.sws.pipe-piling.com/auth/ims/login/\\"","username : \\"Arun1\\"","password : \\"ofbiz\\""]','2026-05-18 10:15:46','2026-07-31 04:27:22',1,'P1','["UX", "resilience", "functional"]',1,0),
(37832,NULL,103,1108,5534,'Optimized','DSTC_107 : Verify warehouse transfer with OTHERS & ATTCH','["Navigate to the URL","Enter the username","Enter the password","Click the login button","Click the Edit Company icon, then select PPMTL","Open the Intransit screen from the left menu","Click the Warehouse Transfer link","Expand the From location dropdown","Select the From location","Expand the To location dropdown","Select the To location","Click the Find button to add attachment and Other product type","Expand the Product type dropdown","Click on OTHER","Click the Search button","Click the checkbox to select the Product ID","Click on Add Product","Update the quantity to transfer","Click the Create Bulk In Transit button","Wait for 5 seconds","Click the Close (X) button","Click the left menu bar to expand","Click on Intransit Shipment","Verify the latest transaction","Click the Edit icon to generate shipment and receive","Update Qty To Pick (PCS)","Click outside","Click the Generate Picklist button","Click on Generate BOL","Verify the Transit ID","Click the Close (X) button","Click on Intransit","Click on Receive Transit","Click on the Edit button","Update Qty Received (PCS)","Click outside","Click on Receive Inventory","Click on the OK button","Verify the transit details are displayed correctly after Receive Inventory"]','1. In tranit should be created from PPBC as from and PPCAL and To yard. 2. Qty entered should be displayed at Qty  to transfer for both the items. 3. In transit pdf should be enabled and should be opened on click from the print button. 4. User should be able to ship the material and Inventory of both the products should be reduced from the from side. 5. PPCAL user should have warehouse shipment displayed on their screen on receive In transit screen. 6. Inventory should be received on PPCAL yard and receipt pdf should be displayed.','["Username:Arun1","Password:ofbiz","Url: https://ims.sws.pipe-piling.com/dashboard/ims-order/list/",""]','2026-05-18 10:15:46','2026-08-06 15:28:48',1,'P1','["functional", "regression", "critical"]',1,0),
(37833,NULL,103,1108,5534,'Optimized','Verify BOL generation','["Navigate to the URL.","Enter a valid username.","Enter a valid password.","Click on the Login button.","Navigate to the Shipping module.","Open the Approved List and click on the Edit button for the order that needs to be shipped.","Click on New to create a new picklist.","In the Picklist section, enter the required quantity in Qty to Pick.","Click on Generate Picklist.","Click on Generate BOL.","Verify that the BOL is generated successfully with the correct shipment details."]','"1. Shipping window should open. 2. Page should open to generate picklist. 3. Picklist should generate. 4. BOL should generate. 5. PDF should have 3 copies. It should have below details: an) Company name b) Consignee name c) Picking location address. d) Shipping date and shipment number. e) order number, point of origin and name of carrier. f) Item quantity and description."','["Username:Arun1","Password:ofbiz","Url: https://ims.sws.pipe-piling.com/dashboard/ims-order/list/"]','2026-05-18 10:15:46','2026-07-16 17:43:54',1,'P1','["functional", "regression", "boundary_value"]',1,0),
