(37838,NULL,103,1108,5536,'Optimized','DSTC-07 : Verify if change location and item location is working as expected in the sales order and edit','["Navigate to the sales order list page","Enter username","Enter password","Click on Login button","Click the Edit Company icon, then select PPBC","Click on Order link in the left-side menu","Click on + (Add/New) button to create a new order","Open the Order Location dropdown","Select ECLIPS from the Order Location dropdown","Click the Find button for Product Lookup","Open the Product Type dropdown","Select BEAM from the Product Type dropdown","Open the Type dropdown","Select BPB from the Type dropdown","Verify the Order Location is set to ECLIPS","Click the Search button to find products","Verify BPB Beam products are displayed with description \'Bearing Pile Beam\'","Select the checkbox for the product where Actual Yard Stock is greater than 0 and Stock on Sales Order is equal to 0","Select a product with available inventory using the checkbox","Click the Add Product button","Click on find button to select shipping address","click on plus button to add address","Wait for 10 sec","Click the PCE unit cell in the grid","Validate the item location for the item should be Eclipse","Click the Save button to create the order","Open the Order Location dropdown again","Select PPBC from the Order Location dropdown","click outside","Click the Find button for Product Lookup","Click the Search button","Select the checkbox for the product where Actual Yard Stock is greater than 0 and Stock on Sales Order is equal to 0","Click the Add Product button","Enter Product ID in the Product is field","Click the Add Products button","click on save button","Click the PCE unit cell in the second grid","Validate the item location for the item should be PPBC","Click the PCE unit cell in the third grid","Validate the item location for the item should be PPBC"]','1. location on Inventory look should be Eclipse. 2. BPB beams should be displayed with Bearing Pile Beams in description or BPB in product id. 3. Item location should be shown as Eclpse on selecting the item on the cart in the sales order. 4.  location on Inventory look should be PPBC. 5. Item location should be shown as PPBC after adding from inventory on selecting the item on the cart in the sales order.','["Username:Arun1","Password:ofbiz","Url:https://ims.sws.pipe-piling.com/dashboard/ims-order/list/"]','2026-05-18 10:15:46','2026-08-21 18:54:43',1,'P1','["functional", "integration", "smoke", "AC5"]',1,0),
