(37846,NULL,103,1108,5538,'Optimized','DSTC_122: Verify Monthly progression report for All Canada and check if deta is there','["Navigate to the IMS login page","Enter username","Enter password","Login with admin user","Click Edit company icon","Select PPMTL","Wait for 5 seconds","Click on Reports","Click on Inventory Reports","Wait for 2 seconds","Click on Monthly Progression Report","Expand Location Dropdown","Select ALL CANADA","Wait for 2 seconds","Click on From Date Calendar","Click on Previous Month","Select First Date","Wait for 5 seconds","Click on To Date Calendar","Click on Previous Month","Select Last Date","Click on Search","Wait for 10 seconds","Verify row count is at least 1","Wait for 2 seconds","Click on Excel Export button","Wait for 10 seconds"]','1. Report screen opens successfully for the admin user. 2. Monthly Progress Report selected from the Inventory Report tab successfully. 3. Last month\'s first and end dates accepted in the From and To date fields. 4. Location "ALL Canada" applied and search executes successfully displaying results. 5. Delta values displayed correctly on the result screen. 6. Excel file downloaded successfully and contains valid (non-empty) data.','["url: https://ims.pipe-piling.com/auth/ims/login","username: TestA","password: ofbiz"]','2026-05-18 10:15:47','2026-07-25 16:44:19',1,'P2','["session-management", "integration", "data-integrity"]',1,0),
