(37905,NULL,103,1110,5558,'Optimized','DSTC_23 - Verify user is able to load item directly by load In transit in Sales Order creation','["Open the Login URL","Enter Username","Enter Password","Click the Login button","Click the Edit Company icon, then select PPMTL","Click Order from the left navigation menu","Click the Create New Order button","Enter the Bill Address in the Find field","Click the Find button to search for the Bill Address","Click the Add button to add the Bill Address","Enter the Purchase Order ID in the Upload Intransit Details field","Click the Upload Intransit Details icon","Click the Save button","Assert that the Edit Order screen is displayed","Verify that the user is able to create a Sales Order and the Edit Order screen is displayed."]','Verify below things 1. IMS login page loads successfully in the browser with Username field, Password field, and Login button visible.   2. Username and password are accepted in their fields; password is masked with dots/asterisks. No validation errors appear.  3. User is authenticated and redirected to the Home page. Left navigation menu, header are displayed. 4. Order page loads; Order grid/list is displayed with toolbar (Create New Order button, filters, etc.).  5. Item added in In transit should upload to Sales order screen with the same qty and location and user should be able to create sales order','["Login URL: https://ims.sws.pipe-piling.com/auth/ims/login/?returnTo=%2Fdashboard%2Fims-order%2Flist%2F","Username: TestA","Password: ofbiz"]','2026-05-22 13:47:56','2026-07-25 14:46:29',1,'P1','["audit", "inventory", "history", "compliance"]',1,0),
