(37907,NULL,103,1110,5559,'Optimized','J-02 Sales Order Journey with Sales Report','["1. Login with business user and Select PPBC company.","2. Navigate to Order screen and add customer.","3. Now add the item from the inventory look up- Pipe- OD-30.000 and Wallt-0.500.","4. Add any three item with inventory available and click add products.","5.  Update the qty order to 10 and price-108.35 and Price UOM FT.","6. Validate subtotal of the line item- ","7. Select the 2nd item and change to Qty 5 and Price 239.25 per Meter","8. Select item#3 and keep the Qty 12 PCS and update price to 1.05 and Price UOM- LBS.","9. Save the order and approve the order.","10. Validate item qty and price after order creation.","11. Validate total of each individual line item and total on the right hand side.","12. Validate taxes both GST and PST are 5 and 7 % of subtotal value.","13. Copy subtotal of the order and order id and navigate to report- Open Order sales summary- Select company as PPBC and click search-now select the checkbox  and click order level details.","14. Select sales agent- same user which you logged and view type- Order,  click search- validate order# is displayed and check Original order value and Balance O/S value is matching the order.","15. Ship the each item in different shipment- Select first item and update qty to pick as per order qty and generate Pick and BOL.","16. Create the shipment for other two items separately.","17. Now navigate to Shipment to Invoice screen and invoice each shipment separtely.","18. Navigate to Invoice screen and validate total of each line item is same as Order screen.","18. Copy the invoice id and subotal and grand total value from Invoice screen and navigate to export report under admin screen- now enter company as PPBC and enter Invoice# and click search- validate subtotal and grand total value is matching.","19. Copy the PPMTL COGS total value and navigate to Daily stock movement report- enter Invoice id and select company as PPBC and click search- validate total cost value at the bottom is matching with PPMTL COGS total value from the export report.","20. Cancel one of the invoice and then navigate to Credit note screen and check Credit note is shown with the invoice id in the same company.","21. Validate the subtotal price is same as Invoice screen."]','1. Login is successful. PPBC company is selected and dashboard reflects PPBC context. 2. Order screen loads. Customer is added and displayed on the order header. 3. Inventory lookup returns results for OD-30.000 and Wall-0.500. Item is added to the order. 4. All three items with available inventory are added as separate line items. No errors shown. 5. Qty = 10, Price = 108.35, Price UOM = FT saved successfully on line item 1. 6. Subtotal of line item 1 = 10 × 108.35 = 1,083.50. 7. Line item 2 updated: Qty = 5, Price = 239.25, UOM = Meter. Subtotal = 1,196.25. 8. Line item 3 updated: Qty = 12, Price = 1.05, UOM = LBS. Subtotal = 12.60. 9. Order saves with an assigned Order ID. Status changes to Approved. 10. All line item qty and prices persist correctly after save: Item1(10/108.35/FT), Item2(5/239.25/Meter), Item3(12/1.05/LBS). 11. Line totals: Item1=1,083.50 | Item2=1,196.25 | Item3=12.60 | Order Subtotal=2,292.35. 12. GST (5%) = 114.62 | PST (7%) = 160.46 | Grand Total = 2,567.43. Values match calculated amounts. 13. Order appears in Open Order Sales Summary for PPBC. Order level details show correct line breakdown. 14. Order number displayed in report. Original Order Value and Balance O/S = 2,292.35. 15. Shipment 1 created for item 1 with Pick Qty = 10. Pick and BOL generated successfully. 16. Shipment 2 created for item 2 (Qty 5) and Shipment 3 for item 3 (Qty 12). Pick and BOL generated for each. 17. Invoice 1, 2, and 3 created from Shipment 1, 2, and 3 respectively. Each invoice reflects correct item and qty. 18. Invoice line totals match order: Invoice5 | Invoice3=12.60. 18. Subtotal and grand total in Export Report match Invoice screen values for the entered Invoice ID under PPBC. 19. Total cost in Daily Stock Movement Report matches PPMTL COGS total from Export Report. 20. Invoice status changes to Cancelled. Creible under PPBC with the correct Invoice ID. 21. Credit Note subtotal matches the subtotal of the cancelled invoice exactly.','["Login URL: https://ims.sws.pipe-piling.com/auth/ims/login/?returnTo=%2Fdashboard%2Fims-order%2Flist%2F","Username: TestA","Password: ofbiz",""]','2026-05-22 13:47:56','2026-08-19 14:57:02',1,'P1','["functional", "revenue", "core_flow", "smoke"]',1,0),
