o order. 5. Item should be selected and item should be added in item list on order screen. 6. Default quantity should be 1 and after entering new quantity it should be updated. 7. Default price should show 999 and after entering new price updated price should show. 8. Order should be saved and should move to created status. In order header table order status should be created. 9. Order should be approved and should move to approved status. In order header table order status should be approved.','["url: https://ims.sws.pipe-piling.com/auth/ims/login","username: TestA","password: ofbiz"]','2026-05-25 06:51:44','2026-09-04 12:00:43',1,'P1','["Integration", "Functional"]',1,0),
