(38070,NULL,103,1126,5617,'Optimized','RTC_14: Verify the sales order hold with product type Pipe and Attch','[""]','1. Attach item should be held after order creation(Hold allocation should be assigned as per the inventory available) 2. User should be able to generate the shipment and hold allocation should be updated as per the ship QTY (Lets say Order 5 and ship 3, hold requested and allocated should be updated 3 PCS)','["url: https://ims.sws.pipe-piling.com/auth/ims/login","username: TestA","password: ofbiz",""]','2026-06-30 10:52:59','2026-09-01 11:47:08',1,'P1','["functional", "search", "search_filters", "equivalence_partitioning"]',1,0),
