(38072,NULL,103,1126,5618,'Optimized','RTC_16 : Verify if user partially transfer the quantity with bulk secure transfer','[""]','1. Hold allocated should be reduced after shipping the item from PPTML in warehouse shipment. 2. One user receive the warehouse shipment and new row should be added to Sales with Canphx location and item with PPTML should be updated with received quantity(order quantity minus received quantity) 3. Hold should be assigned to item at Canphx location now and user should be able to ship the material from Canphx','["url: https://ims.sws.pipe-piling.com/auth/ims/login","username: TestA","password: ofbiz"]','2026-06-30 10:52:59','2026-09-05 08:28:10',1,'P1','["functional", "UI", "smoke"]',1,0),
