(38074,NULL,103,1126,5619,'Optimized','RTC_17: Verify if user change the receiving location with bulk secure transfer during the receive','[""]','1. New item row should be added to sales order with the updated location during receive. 2. Hold requested and Hold allocated should also be updated automatically for the newly added item and item at PPEST should be marked completed.','["url: https://ims.sws.pipe-piling.com/auth/ims/login","username: TestA","password: ofbiz",""]','2026-06-30 10:53:00','2026-07-21 10:51:03',1,'P1','["functional", "UI"]',1,0),
