(38119,NULL,103,1129,5637,'Optimized','Verify bulk transfer flow with coil and its status on inventory search','["Enter Order ID \'ORD002\' in Field1","Enter Customer ID \'CUST124\' in Field2","Enter Deposit 800 in Field3","Enter Quantity 2 in Field4","Enter Price 400 in Field5","Click Save","Verify order status is \'Pending\'","Verify Order ID is \'ORD002\'","Verify Customer ID is \'CUST124\'","Verify Deposit is 800","Verify Quantity is 2","Verify Price is 400"]','1. B/O on bulk transfer is showing the coil weight. 2. Actual yard stock should be shown as zero and Bulk transfer inbound is showing the coil weight after BOL generation. 3. Bulk Transfer Inbound (LBS) should display zero and B/O on bulk transfer is also zero and actual stock should display the coil weight','["Login URL: https://ims.sws.pipe-piling.com/auth/ims/login/?returnTo=%2Fdashboard%2Fims-order%2Flist%2F","Username: TestA","Password: ofbiz"]','2026-07-06 06:33:07','2026-07-31 10:01:10',1,'P1','["functional", "UI", "smoke"]',1,0),
