(38127,NULL,103,1130,5642,'Optimized','RTC_32: Verify user is able to update ship to address during creation and edit','["1. Login as PPMTL user and navigate to Sales order screen and initiate create a new order.","2. Add the customer by entering the keyword \\"ETPO\' and click search icon beside it.","3. Select the customer and click add.","4. Click on edit button on Shipment address section and update address line 1, 2 and city and zip code and click update button","5. Now add the items and change the price.","6.Click on save button and approved the order.","7. Validate the Ship to address is showing updated address- check address 1, 2, city, and zip code"]','1.The system should show the pop-up(Are you sure to close the order). 2.After click on close order the order status should come in completed status. 3.Order notes should also update with user name.','["url: https://ims.sws.pipe-piling.com/auth/ims/login","username: TestA","password: ofbiz",""]','2026-07-06 06:42:03','2026-07-23 06:06:33',1,'P1','["functional", "search"]',1,0),
