(38130,NULL,103,1130,5643,'Optimized','DSTC_30 : Verify if user can add new item directly in the shipment on edit shipment','["1. Launch and navigate to IMS login page using URL","2. Enter valid username","3. Enter valid password","4. Click on the ‘Login’ button","5. Click on Expand button in left MuiBox","6. Click Edit company icon","7. Select PPMTL","8. Wait for 5 seconds","9. Click on Order menu","10. Click button to create a new order","11. Click on search icon beside the Find Bill Address","12. Enter \'ABM100_PPMTL\' in Customer ID","13. Click on search","14. Click on Add button","15. Click the Find button for the product search field","16. Wait for 2 seconds","17. Open product type dropdown","18. Select product type as PIPE","19. Wait for 2 seconds","20. Click the Search button to execute product search","21. Select the checkbox of the first product where Stock on S/O equals 0 and Actual Yard Stock is greater than 2","22. Click the Add Products button to add the selected product","23. Wait for 2 seconds","24. Scroll unit price into viewport","25. Click on Unit Price","26. Fill Unit Price with 88","27. Click outside grid","28. Click the Save button to save the new order","29. Wait for 2 seconds","30. Read and capture the Order # caption near the Edit Order header","31. Wait for 5 seconds","32. Click Order Actions button and then Click Approver Order","33. Wait for 2 seconds","34. Click the close icon to dismiss the dialog","35. Wait for 2 seconds","36. Click the Shipping button in left navigation","37. Wait for 5 seconds","38. Enter captured Order # into the Order # search field","39. Click the Submit button to filter the shipping grid","40. Wait for 2 seconds","41. Click on edit button","42. Wait for 5 seconds","43. Click on Qty to pickup on grid","44. Fill qty to pick","45. Click outside grid","46. Wait for 2 seconds","47. Click on Generate Picklist Button","48. Wait for 5 seconds","49. Click the Generate BOL button","50. Wait for 5 seconds","51. Wait for 5 seconds","52. Click on edit button","53. Wait for 2 seconds","54. Verify Edit Shipment text is displayed at header","55. Click the Find button for the product search field","56. Wait for 2 seconds","57. Open product type dropdown","58. Select product type as PIPE","59. Wait for 2 seconds","60. Click the Search button to execute product search","61. Select the checkbox of the first product where Stock on S/O equals 0 and Actual Yard Stock is greater than 2","62. Click the Add Products button to add the selected product","63. Wait for 2 seconds","64. Click on Qty Ordered on grid","65. Fill Qty Ordered","66. Click outside grid","67. Wait for 2 seconds","68. Click on Qty to Ship on grid","69. Fill qty to ship","70. Click outside grid","71. Wait for 2 seconds","72. Click the Generate BOL button","73. Wait for 5 seconds","74. Capture the Product ID at row 2","75. Wait for 2 seconds","76. Click cross icon to close the Manage Shipment screen","77. Wait for 5 seconds","78. Click on Order menu","79. Wait for 5 seconds","80. Enter captured Order #","81. Click on Search","82. Wait for 5 seconds","83. Click on Edit","84. Wait for 2 seconds","85. Verify new item added at row 2 has the same Product ID as in the shipment screen","86. Wait for 2 seconds","87. Verify Unit Price is 999.00 for item added at row 2","88. Wait for 2 seconds","89. Verify Qty Shipped Value is equal to Qty Shipped in the shipment screen","90. Wait for 2 seconds","91. Click on close icon to close order edit screen","92. Wait for 2 seconds","93. Click on Inventory","94. Click on Inventory History","95. Enter Captured Product ID into Product ID","96. Select Location as PPMTL","97. Select today date in from field","98. Click on search","99. Wait for 2 seconds","100. Assert that visible row count in Inventory history is at least 1","101. Scroll Qty Decr. (- Pcs) in viewport","102. Wait for 2 seconds","103. Verify that the Qty Decr. (-Pcs) value for the Order ID in the row is reduced by the specified quantity value.",""]','1.Item added from inventory should be shown on both order & shipment screen. 2. Inventory should be deducted for the newly added item and should also displayed on BOL Pdf.','["url: https://ims.sws.pipe-piling.com/auth/ims/login","username: TestA","password: ofbiz",""]','2026-07-06 06:42:03','2026-09-04 15:57:22',1,'P1','["login", "validation", "functional"]',1,0),
