(38132,NULL,103,1130,5643,'Optimized','RTC_36: Verify by adding extra items from different location','["1. Go to shipping.","2. Go to approved list and click on order for shipping.","3. On picklist add quantity to pick and generate picklist.","4. On manage shipment page, click on edit and then find button to add more item.","5. Select item from another yard and add it.","6. Generate BOL."]','1. Shipping window should open. 2. Page to generate picklist should open. 3. Picklist should generated and manage shipment page should open. 4. Product lookup window should open and on adding item should be added and should show on manage shipment page. 5. Item should be added and should show on shipping page. 6. BOL should be generated and same details and quantity should show in BOL pdf.','["url: https://ims.sws.pipe-piling.com/auth/ims/login","username: TestA","password: ofbiz",""]','2026-07-06 06:42:03','2026-07-24 08:01:39',1,'P1','["order", "cancel", "functional", "pm"]',1,0),
