(38139,NULL,103,1131,5646,'Optimized','RTC_35: Verify user is able to cancel the BOL','["1. Go to shipping.","2. Go to approved list and click on order for shipping.","3. On picklist click on find button to add more items. ","4. On lookup window, select an product and add it.","5. Enter quantity to pick and generate picklist and then generate the BOL","6. On shipment page, click on cancel shipment.","7. Select an reason from dropdown list and add some comment in comment box and ","cancel.\\"","8. Validate the shipment status is marked cancelled on shipment edit and shipment list screen and check inventory history and qty shipped on order screen should be be reduced"]','"1. Shipping window should open. 2. Page should open to generate picklist. 3. Product lookup window should open. 4. Product should  be added and should show in item list, order balance should be 1.  5. Quantity should be added and picklist should generate. Same details should show in picklist PDF and in order detail. 6. Pop-up to select reason and add comment should open. 7. Shipment should cancel and window should show with cancelled mark on the shipment." 8. Inventory history should display cancellation and return of inventory. 9. Qty shipped of the item which was shipped and cancelled should be reduced as per the Qty shipped','["url: https://ims.sws.pipe-piling.com/auth/ims/login","username: TestA","password: ofbiz",""]','2026-07-06 07:59:48','2026-07-31 11:18:38',1,'P1','["functional", "logout"]',1,0),
