(38142,NULL,103,1131,5647,'Optimized','RTC_41: Verify Carrier BOL, is updating after picklist creation picklist [DO NOT USE]','["1. Go to shipping.","2. Go to approved list and click on order for shipping.","3. On picklist add item quantity to pick.","5. Generate picklist.","6. Now click edit button on shipment and enter carrier and Carrier BOL, Reference#"]','1. Shipping Carrier and Carrier BOL should be shown on screen as entered by screen after Picklist creation and BOL. 2. Same details should be reflected on BOL pdf. 3. Check shipping carrier and carrier BOL on daily stock movement report','["url: https://ims.sws.pipe-piling.com/auth/ims/login","username: TestA","password: ofbiz",""]','2026-07-06 07:59:49','2026-08-03 09:00:59',1,'P1','["edge", "filters", "boundaryvalue"]',1,0),
(38143,NULL,103,1131,5648,'Optimized','RTC_41: Verify Carrier BOL, is updating after picklist creation picklist','["1. Go to shipping.","2. Go to approved list and click on order for shipping.","3. On picklist add item quantity to pick.","5. Generate picklist.","6. Now click edit button on shipment and enter carrier and Carrier BOL, Reference#"]','1. Shipping Carrier and Carrier BOL should be shown on screen as entered by screen after Picklist creation and BOL. 2. Same details should be reflected on BOL pdf. 3. Check shipping carrier and carrier BOL on daily stock movement report','["url: https://ims.sws.pipe-piling.com/auth/ims/login","username: TestA","password: ofbiz",""]','2026-07-06 07:59:49','2026-08-03 09:02:37',1,'P1','["functional", "order_creation", "P1"]',1,0),
(38144,NULL,103,1131,5648,'Optimized','RTC_42: Verify Carrier BOL & reference# edit in picklist editing','["1. Go to shipping.","2. Go to approved list and click on order for shipping.","3. On picklist add item quantity to pick.","4. Enter value in carrier BOL.","5. Generate picklist.","6. Go to shipment list and search for the same shipment.","7. Open picklist and click on edit picklist.","8. Enter updated value in carrier BOL and reference# and click on generate BOL.","9. Verify BOL and shipment in shipment list."]','1. Shipping window should open. 2. Page to generate picklist should open. 3. Item quantity should be add. 4. Value should enter. 5. Picklist should generated. Carrier BOL should show on picklist page, picklist pdf. 6. It should show on shipment list and carrier BOL value should show in column on shipment. 7. Picklist should open and it should open to edit. 8. Value should entered and BOL should generated. 9. Updated carrier BOL should show in BOL and in shipment list updated value should show for Carrier Bol column.','["url: https://ims.sws.pipe-piling.com/auth/ims/login","username: TestA","password: ofbiz",""]','2026-07-06 07:59:49','2026-08-03 13:04:47',1,'P2','["functional", "validation", "P2"]',1,0),
(38145,NULL,103,1131,5649,'Optimized','RTC_44: Verify shipping instructions in BOL','["1. Go to shipping.","2. Go to approved list and click on order for shipping.","3. On picklist add item quantity and generate picklist.","4. On picklist click on edit.","5. Add shipping instructions and generate BOL.","7. Verify BOL.","8. Click on edit to edit BOL.","9. Update shipping instructions and save.","10. Verify BOL."]','Shipping instructions should show in BOL pdf. When user is editing shipping instructions then updated instruction should show in BOL after saving it.','["url: https://ims.sws.pipe-piling.com/auth/ims/login","username: TestA","password: ofbiz",""]','2026-07-06 07:59:49','2026-08-03 15:59:38',1,'P1','["functional", "order", "cancellation", "happy"]',1,0),
(38146,NULL,103,1131,5649,'Optimized','RTC_45: Verify daily stock movement with BOL cancellation','["1. Go to shipping.","2. Go for order and create shipping of product by generating BOL.","3. Go to reports and click on Daily stock movement report.","4. Select yard from where item picked in BOL, Product type and date.","5. Click on search.","6. Verify item movement from stock.","7. Go to shipping and cancel the same shipment.","8. Go to daily stock movement and verify."]','After cancelling shipment, deduction line should remove and no deduction should show. Item should revert back to inventory. Stock type should show outgoing.','["url: https://ims.sws.pipe-piling.com/auth/ims/login","username: TestA","password: ofbiz",""]','2026-07-06 07:59:49','2026-08-04 08:10:47',1,'P2','["functional", "order", "cancellation", "edge", "validation"]',0,0),
(38147,NULL,103,1131,5650,'Optimized','RTC_38: Verify by shipping item from multiple locations','["1. Go to shipping.","2. Go to approved list and click on order for shipping.","3. On picklist add quantity to pick and generate picklist.","4. On manage shipment page click pick from additional location and select one yard.","5. Add partial quantity to pick from that yard and generate BOL.","6. Verify backend and BOL.","7. Click on new on same BOL to generate new BOL.","8. Select some items to pick and generate picklist.","9. On manage shipment click on edit.","10. Click on pick from additional location.","11. Select an different yard this time to add.","12. Update items to ship and generate BOL.","13. Verify BOL and location\'s inventory in backend."]','1. User should be able to create shipping from multiple yards for an order. 2. When user is changing location then another row should added with zero item. 3. Bol should be generated and item quantity, picking yard address should show in BOL. 4. In backend inventory should be deducted from inventory of yard, from which item has picked for shipping.','["url: https://ims.sws.pipe-piling.com/auth/ims/login","username: TestA","password: ofbiz",""]','2026-07-06 07:59:50','2026-08-04 13:40:31',1,'P1','["functional", "core", "order-pdf"]',0,0),
(38148,NULL,103,1131,5650,'Optimized','RTC_50: Verify Shipment generation for Generic Pipe','["1. Order should be created and approved. ","2.Go to shipment screen & select order with generic item","3. Click plus button against generic item on the cart","4. Select items from inventory look up and add in the shipment","5.  Update to Qty to pick for all the items added against generic individually","6. Click on generate picklist and then generate BOL","7. Verify the shipment screen and inventory history and inventory hold."]','1. Item against generic should be added in the shipment and should have the same sequence as Generic item 2. BOL should be generated and inventory should be reduced for the added item. 3. Qty shipped against the generic line item should be updated and should match the Qty shipped.','["url: https://ims.sws.pipe-piling.com/auth/ims/login","username: TestA","password: ofbiz","",""]','2026-07-06 07:59:50','2026-08-05 07:07:37',1,'P2','["functional", "invalid-pdf"]',0,0),
(38149,NULL,103,1131,5650,'Optimized','RTC_48: Verify if user can ship the material in advance by picking the ship date 3 from the currenct date','["1.Crete an order and add the items . ","2.Go to shipment screen and pick the quantity.    ","3.Click ship date and check if user can pick 3 days from the current date and generate the picklist of the items.","4.Generate the bol of the items.","5.Edit the shipment and check if user can change the date 3 days further.","6.Generate the BOL and check ship date again is future dated.","7.Verify the inventory history shows the transaction date as future dated as per the ship date"]','1. User should be allowed to pick three date in future from the current date. 2. Date selected should be updated after picklist generation. 3. User should not be allowed pick further future date on edit shipment. 4. Inventory history should display the selected future date on the shipment','["url: https://ims.sws.pipe-piling.com/auth/ims/login","username: TestA","password: ofbiz"]','2026-07-06 07:59:50','2026-08-06 07:18:53',1,'P1','["integration", "pdf-viewer"]',1,0),
(38175,NULL,103,1133,5659,'Optimized','RTC_19: Verify edit shipment with Generic hold and shipment cancellation','["1. Create an sales order with Generic item pipe.","2. Check hold allocated and requested is updating as per the child inventory available against the generic item.","3. Create the shipments for generic item by adding two child item in the shipment.","4. Edit the shipment and click plus button against the generic to add another length in the shipment.","5. Update the qty to ship for the added item and generate the BOL.","6. Now copy the child product added in the shipment and click cancel shipment and validate qty shipped against generic is updated back to 0  and check inventory history for child items"]','1. Hold allocated should be assigned to generic item as per the child inventory available. 2. Hold should also be shown on Hold inventory report by searching with OD and wallt. 3. User should be able to add items on edit shipment and BOL should be generated. 4. Qty shipped should be updated against the generic and hold should also be updated after BOL generation. 5. Inventory history should show the child items inventory reduced for this shipment id. 6. Shipment status should be marked cancelled and generic shipped should be updated to zero and hold allocation should reverted back to the original number and inventory deducted for the child items should also returned back','["url: https://ims.pipe-piling.com/auth/ims/login","username: TestA","password: ofbiz",""]','2026-07-31 16:19:21','2026-08-06 15:51:51',1,'P1','["functional", "validation"]',1,0),
(38176,NULL,103,1133,5659,'Optimized','RTC_20: Verify hold release feature with the item held in two different sales order','["1. Create an sales order with the Non generic item (Pipe with length greater than >1 (should have 10 PCS)- update Qty order as the Actual stock available and create the sales order#1","2. Duplicate the same order and add qty as 5 PCS and create the sales order#2","3. Check the hold allocation in order#2 (hold allocation should be zero).","4. Copy the product code and item location and now navigate to Inventory on hold screen under inventory module and enter the product id and location and click search","5. Two different rows should be shown and then select the order#1 and click edit icon and check deficiency is 5 pcs and hold allocation is 0 for order#2 row","6. Enter order# in release for order and select the product code from the look and then add qty to release as 5.","7. Click release hold.","8. Now check hold allocation- should be updated to 5 and deficiency should be updated to 0","9. Check the hold allocation for order#-  should be reduced by 5 PCS and deficiency should be updated to 5","10. Now navigate to shipment screen and try to generate BOL for Order# and check the hold allocation should be allocation to 0 in the sales order screen."]','1. Hold allocation for the order#2 should be zero. 2. Inventory on hold screen should display both the orders. 3. Hold allocation should be zero for order#1 and deficiency should be 5 PCS and deficiency should be zero for order#1 and allocation should be there. 4. Hold details pop up should be shown and hold should be released fro m order#1 to order#2. 5. hold allocation- should be updated to 5 and deficiency should be updated to 0 for order#1 row. 6. hold allocation for order#-  should be reduced by 5 PCS and deficiency should be updated to 5 7. User should be able to ship the order#2 and qty shipped and hold allocation should be updated to 0 after BOL generation.','["url: https://ims.pipe-piling.com/auth/ims/login","username: TestA","password: ofbiz",""]','2026-07-31 16:19:21','2026-08-09 12:14:44',1,'P2','["functional", "ui"]',1,0),
(38177,NULL,103,1133,5661,'Optimized','RTC_6: Verify when user try to duplicate the order having  customer inactive in Weboe.','["1. Login with Business user and select PPEAST company.","2. Create an sales order with any active customer and copy the customer id.","3. Now login with admin user","4. Navigate to admin module and then click Customer Client module.","5. Search for the customer by entering customer id","6. Click disable button on right","7. Selected customer should not be displayed now on customer client screen.","8. Now login with regular user and select PPEST company.","9. Navigate to Order and first check order created is showing and check user able to open the edit screen and check ship to and bill to section display customer details.","10. Click action button and click duplicate order",""]','1. Customer should get inactive and should not visible on customer screen and on Order customer look up. 2. System should show validation to the user that \'Customer is inactive in Weboe\' on click duplicate order and user should not be able to place the order','["url: https://ims.sws.pipe-piling.com/auth/ims/login","username: Krishna","password: ofbiz"]','2026-07-31 16:19:21','2026-08-10 07:29:27',1,'P2','["functional", "logout"]',1,0),
(38178,NULL,103,1133,5663,'Optimized','RTC_2: Verify user update from the admin user and its access update like companies assigned  and assigned screen to the user is working correctly.','["Launch the IMS application and navigate to the login page using the URL.","Enter a valid username","Enter a valid password","Click on the \'Login\' button","Click on Expand button in left MuiBox","Click on Admin","Click on Manage User","Click on Add New User"]','1. Admin user should be able to setup the new user and user should display on manage user screen after creation 2. Company name should be shown on top right ( \'Pipe & Piling Supplies Ltd) and no other company should be shown on drop down 3. French view should be shown and user should only have Order, Inventory and Intransit and help module on the left side 4. User should be able to browse all the modules with no error on screen 5. Inventory search should be working','["URL: https://ims.sws.pipe-piling.com/auth/ims/login/?returnTo=%2Fdashboard%2Fims-order%2Flist%2F","Username: TestA","Password: ofbiz"]','2026-07-31 16:19:21','2026-08-10 13:00:13',1,'P1','["functional", "UI", "smoke"]',1,0),
(38179,NULL,103,1133,5663,'Optimized','RTC_110: Verify system creates Sales automatically when PPUSA user raised PO to PPMTL','["1.Login with PPUSA user/company and initiate a PPUSA to PPMTL purchase order with supplier- \'S_PPMTL_PPUSA\' and ship to location as Supplier USA","2. Add pickup location and then add 4-5 different items from look up.","3.Click on create button.","4.Automatically created a sales order with same information as Purchase order."]','Sales order should be  automatically created in PPMTL company with same items and same information which PO have.','["url: https://ims.sws.pipe-piling.com/auth/ims/login","username: TestB","password: ofbiz","supplierId: S_PPMTL_PPUSA","shipToLocation: SUPPLIER-USA","pickUpLocation: PPMTL","PPMTL_username:Krishna","PPMTL_password: ofbiz"]','2026-07-31 16:19:21','2026-08-11 06:06:25',1,'P2','["functional", "UI"]',1,0),
(38180,NULL,103,1133,5663,'Optimized','RTC_112: Verify if user cancels the PPUSA to PPMTL PO ','["1.Create an PPUSA purchase order.","2.Open the purchase order.","3.Cancel the purchase order."]','System should show the validation which cancel the purchase order or automatically created sales order should also deleted ','["url: https://ims.sws.pipe-piling.com/auth/ims/login","username: TestA","password: ofbiz","supplierId: S_PPMTL_PPUSA","shipToLocation: SUPPLIER-USA","pickUpLocation: PPMTL","",""]','2026-07-31 16:19:21','2026-08-11 08:11:04',1,'P2','["functional", "UI"]',1,0),
(38181,NULL,103,1133,5665,'Optimized','RTC_113: Verify if user cancels the PPUSA to PPMTL auto created sales order','["1.Create an PPUSA to PPMTL purchase order.","2. Now login with PPMTL user and Open the automatically created sales order.","3.Cancel the sales order."]','System should show the validation while cancelling the sales order.','["url: https://ims.sws.pipe-piling.com/auth/ims/login","username: TestA","password: ofbiz","supplierId: S_PPMTL_PPUSA","shipToLocation: SUPPLIER-USA","pickUpLocation: PPMTL"]','2026-07-31 16:19:21','2026-08-11 11:07:26',1,'P1','["functional", "UI", "validation"]',0,0),
(38182,NULL,103,1133,5665,'Optimized','RTC_114: Verify if user able to delete the item PUSA purchase order.','["1.Create an PPUSA purchase order.","2.Add the item from look up.","3.Select the item and delete the item. "]','Item should be deleted from the purchase order and as well as sales order.','["url: https://ims.sws.pipe-piling.com/auth/ims/login","username: TestA","password: ofbiz","supplierId: S_PPMTL_PPUSA","shipToLocation: SUPPLIER-USA","pickUpLocation: PPMTL",""]','2026-07-31 16:19:21','2026-08-12 05:59:52',1,'P1','["functional", "order", "approval"]',0,0),
(38183,NULL,103,1133,5665,'Optimized','RTC_116: Verify creation of warehouse transfer between PPUSA yards.','["1.Firstly login from PPUSA company.","2.Click on warehouse transfer.","3.Enter the \\"From\\" address (AURBURN)and \\"To\\" address(OMAHA).","4.Add  the items from lookup and enter the qty to transfer.","5.Click on create bulk In transit."]','System should show the created status on In transit screen.','["url: https://ims.sws.pipe-piling.com/auth/ims/login","username: TestA","password: ofbiz","\\"From\\" address (AURBURN)","\\"To\\" address(OMAHA)"]','2026-07-31 16:19:21','2026-08-12 06:56:34',1,'P1','["pdf", "validation", "functional"]',0,0),
(38184,NULL,103,1133,5668,'Optimized','RTC_118: Verify cancellation of In transit.','["1.Login from PPUSA company.","2.Click on In transit tab than click on Warehouse transfer.","3.Enter the \\"From\\" address(OMAHA) and \\"To\\" address(Auburn).","4.Add the items from lookup and enter the qty to transfer.","5.Click on create bulk In transit.","6. Verify click on cancel In transit."]','System should show the cancelled status and inventory  should come back at From location(OMAHA).','["url: https://ims.sws.pipe-piling.com/auth/ims/login","username: TestA","password: ofbiz",""]','2026-07-31 16:19:21','2026-08-12 07:42:32',1,'P1','["functional", "smoke", "order-cancellation"]',1,0),
(38185,NULL,103,1133,5668,'Optimized','RTC_119: Verify order cancellation','["1. Go to order.","2. Click on create new order and complete order creation.","3. On created order window click on cancel order.","4. On confirmation pop-up click ok.","5. Check status of order in order header table.","6. Close cancelled order window.","7. Click on create new order and complete order creation.","8. Approve order.","9. Now click on cancel order to cancel approved order."]','Created order and approved order should cancel. Order status should show cancelled in backend.','["url: https://ims.sws.pipe-piling.com/auth/ims/login","username: TestA","password: ofbiz",""]','2026-07-31 16:19:22','2026-08-12 10:45:18',1,'P1','["functional", "smoke", "order-cancellation"]',1,0),
(38186,NULL,103,1133,5668,'Optimized','RTC_120: Verify all the fields like PO, notes etc. on order screen','["1. Go to order.","2. Click on create new order.","3. Select billing address.","4. Enter project name.","5. Enter PO number.","6. Select order date.","7. Enter order note.","8. Enter shipping instructions.","9. Add item and save order.","10. Verify order status pdf.","11. Complete shipping of order and generate invoice."]','Order should be saved and Project name, PO number, order date, order note, shipping instructions should show in order status pdf, BOL and invoice.','["https://ims.sws.pipe-piling.com/auth/ims/login/?returnTo=%2Fdashboard%2Fims-order%2Flist%2F","username: TestA","password: ofbiz",""]','2026-07-31 16:19:22','2026-08-12 10:59:02',1,'P2','["ui", "navigation", "session"]',1,0),
(38187,NULL,103,1133,5671,'Optimized','RTC_111:  Verify modification(like qty)in shipment should reflect in In transit also.','["1. Navigate to Shipment screen with PPMTL or company based on pickup location of above order.","2. Create the shipment (BOL generation) for any 3 items in PPUSA to PPMTL sales order.","3. Login with PPUSA user and navigate to receive Intransit screen and search for the system generated PO Intransit by BOL#.","4. Undo the receipt on receive In transit screen.","5. Login back with PPCanada user from where shipment was issued. and navigate to shipment screen.","6. Validate if shipment status is changed to BOL In Progress.","7. Open the shipment and click edit button.","8. Remove one item from the shipment by updating qty to ship as 0 and pick another item which was not picked earlier and generate the BOL again","9. Check shipment status is updated to Shipment delievred again.","10. Navigate to PPUSA company and check the same PPUSA intransit tstaus is marked received.","11. Also, same items with same qty as per the SO shipment is displayed in Intransit"]','In transit should be automatically updated once the shipment is modified(generate bol).','["url: https://ims.sws.pipe-piling.com/auth/ims/login","username: TestA","password: ofbiz","",""]','2026-07-31 16:19:22','2026-08-13 06:16:26',1,'P1','["functional", "UI"]',0,0),
(38188,NULL,103,1133,5671,'Optimized','RTC_117: Verify creation of In transit shipment between PPUSA yards and user is able to generate pick list and generate Bol, print the picklist and bol with PPUSA yard location.','["1. Login as PPUSA user - Auburn company","2. Navigate to Intransit shipment screen","3. .Pick the above In transit","4. Enter the qty to pick and generate the picklist and bol.","5. Verify print the picklist and bol with PPUSA yard location.","6. Click edit button and update the qty to ship and generate the BOL again.","7. Now login as Omaha user and navigate to Receive In transit screen and open the In transit again.","8. Now enter the qty to receive less than qty shipped (lets say 7 PCS shippeed, now update qty to receive as 5)","9. Click receive and validate qty received is updated as per the value entered ","10. Copy the product code, transit id  and Navigate to daily stock movement and enter location as Auburn and click search.","11. Validate the qty chnage should be the updated number against bulk shipment  ( Adjustment to Shipment row should be shown with difference of qty as plus value).","12. Now change the location to Omaha and click search- validare qty change should be updated value as postive value"]','1. Validation should be shown on entering more qty than Mill order qty 2. User should be able to edit and pick the item in the shop order. 3. Shop order satus should be updated to created on clicking save button. 4. Qty picked on mill order should be updated as per the shop order qty','["url: https://ims.sws.pipe-piling.com/auth/ims/login","username: TestA","password: ofbiz","\\"From\\" address (AURBURN)","\\"To\\" address(OMAHA)","",""]','2026-07-31 16:19:22','2026-08-13 14:58:12',1,'P2','["functional", "validation", "edge"]',0,0),
(38189,NULL,103,1132,5660,'Optimized','RTC_125 : Verify Carrier BOL is editing in picklist editing','["Open the IMS login page","Enter Username","Enter Password","Click Login button","Click the Edit Company icon","Select PPMTL","Click Order from the left navigation menu","Click the Create New Order button","Enter the Bill Address in the Find field","Click the Find button to search for the Bill Address","Click the Add button to add the Bill Address","Enter Customer Name in Customer PO # input field","Enter Project Name in the Project Name field","Click the Find button next to the Product ID field","Click the Search button to retrieve the product list","Check the checkbox to select the pipe from the list where Actual Yard Stock >= 1 and Stock on S/O = 0.","Click the Add Products button","Click the Qty Ordered field in the grid","Enter the quantity for the first item","Click the Qty Shipped field in the grid","Click the Save button","Click the Order Actions button, then select Approve Order","Capture the Order # displayed near the Edit Order header","Capture the Product ID from the Product ID column in the first row of the grid","Click the Close (X) button","Click Shipping from the left navigation menu","Enter Order # in Order # field","Click the Search button","Click the Edit button","Wait for 10 sec","Enter Carrier BOL in the Carrier BOL input field","Click the Qty to Pick Up field in the grid","Enter the Qty to Pick","Click outside the grid","Click the Generate Picklist button","Read and capture the BOL # number near the Planned In Shipment header","Click the Close (X) button","Click the Purchase Order from the left navigation menu","Click Shipping from the left navigation menu","Enter the BOL # in BOL # input field","Click the Search button","Verify that the \\"Carrier BOL #\\" grid column displays T273773","Click the Edit button","Click the Edit button","Update the Carrier BOL in the Carrier BOL input field","Click the Generate BOL button","Click Close (X) button","Click the Purchase Order from the left navigation menu","Click Shipping from the left navigation menu","Enter the BOL # in BOL # input field","Click the Search button","Verify that the \\"Carrier BOL #\\" grid column displays 23010"]','1. Shipping window should open. 2. Page to generate picklist should open. 3. Item quantity should be add. 4. Value should enter. 5. Picklist should generated. Carrier BOL should show on picklist page, picklist pdf. 6. It should show on shipment list and carrier BOL value should show in column on shipment. 7. Picklist should open and it should open to edit. 8. Value should entered and BOL should generated. 9. Updated carrier BOL should show in BOL and in shipment list updated value should show for Carrier Bol column.','["Login URL: https://ims.sws.pipe-piling.com/auth/ims/login/?returnTo=%2Fdashboard%2Fims-order%2Flist%2F","Username: Nitesh","Password: ofbiz"]','2026-07-31 16:19:25','2026-08-01 14:30:28',1,'P1','["functional", "UI", "smoke"]',1,0),
(38190,NULL,103,1132,5660,'Optimized','RTC_126 - Verify quantity over ship','["Open the IMS login page","Enter Username","Enter Password","Click Login button","Click the Edit Company icon","Select PPMTL","Click Order from the left navigation menu","Click the Create New Order button","Enter the Bill Address in the Find field","Click the Find button to search for the Bill Address","Click the Add button to add the Bill Address","Enter Customer Name in Customer PO # input field","Enter Project Name in the Project Name field","Click the Find button next to the Product ID field","Click the Search button to retrieve the product list","Check the checkbox to select the pipe from the list where Actual Yard Stock >= 1 and Stock on S/O = 0.","Click the Add Products button","Click the Qty Ordered field in the grid","Enter the quantity for the first item","Click the out side of the grid","Click the Save button","Click the Order Actions button, then select Approve Order","Capture the Order # displayed near the Edit Order header","Capture the Product ID from the Product ID column in the first row of the grid","Click the Close (X) button","Click Shipping from the left navigation menu","Enter Order # in Order # field","Click the Search button","Click the Edit button","Wait for 10 sec","Click the Qty to Pick Up field in the grid","Enter the Qty to Pick","Click outside the grid","Click the Generate Picklist button","Click the Generate BOL button","Verify that the Qty Ordered and Qty Shipped grid columns display a value of 1"]','1. Shipping window should open. 2. Page to generate picklist should open. 3. Pop up should come to confirm for over ship with \'ok\' and \'cancel\' button. 4. Item should be added  5. BOL should generated and updated quantity should show in BOL. Same quantity should be reduce from inventory in backend.','["Login URL: https://ims.sws.pipe-piling.com/auth/ims/login/?returnTo=%2Fdashboard%2Fims-order%2Flist%2F","Username: TestA","Password: ofbiz"]','2026-07-31 16:1