(38191,NULL,103,1132,5662,'Optimized','RTC_127 : Verify override quantity for invoice','["Open the IMS login page","Enter Username","Enter Password","Click Login button","Click the Edit Company icon","Select PPMTL","Click Order from the left navigation menu","Click the Create New Order button","Enter the Bill Address in the Find field","Click the Find button to search for the Bill Address","Click the Add button to add the Bill Address","Enter Customer Name in Customer PO # input field","Enter Project Name in the Project Name field","Click the Find button next to the Product ID field","Click the Search button to retrieve the product list","Check the checkbox to select the pipe from the list where Actual Yard Stock >= 1 and Stock on S/O = 0.","Click the Add Products button","Click the Qty Ordered field in the grid","Enter the quantity for the first item","Click the Qty Shipped field in the grid","Click the Save button","Click the Order Actions button, then select Approve Order","Capture the Order # displayed near the Edit Order header","Capture the Product ID from the Product ID column in the first row of the grid","Click the Close (X) button","Click Shipping from the left navigation menu","Enter Order # in Order # field","Click the Search button","Click the Edit button","Wait for 10 sec","Click the Qty to Pick Up field in the grid","Enter the Qty to Pick","Click outside the grid","Click the Generate Picklist button","Click the Edit button","Click the Override Qty for Invoice field","Click on Override Qty for Invoice","Enter the updated value and store it in the `updated_qty` variable","Click the Generate BOL button","Verify that the \\"Override Qty for Invoice\\" grid column displays the value stored in the `updated_qty` variable"]','1. Shipping window should open. 2. Page to generate picklist should open. 3. Picklist should be generated. 4. Window should open to edit picklist. 5. A column should add in details to override quantity for invoice. 6. Value should be ent