(38205,NULL,103,1134,5667,'Optimized','RTC_149: Verify shop Order creation with Canpho Mill Order','["1. Login as Canpho ","2. Navigate to Shop Order screen.","3. Click create ship Order and enter Mill Order.","4. Validate all the Mill Order items are displaying.","5. Select Machine # from dropdown and enter shop Order qty for some of the items (Lets say out of 3 only pick 2)","6. Click create shop order.","7. Enter Coil details and Attachment details.","8.  After filling coil details and attachment- click create shop order.","9. Validate shop Order qty is showing updated and approve button is enabled.","10.  Validate shop order report and detail shop order report pdf button is enabled and pdf is printed on clicking on them.","11. Validate coil items and attachment details are being displayed as enter before creation.","12.  Now login with shop order admin user and navigate to shop order screen from the same company and Click approve button and see shop order status on list screen is showing approved"]','"1. Validation should be shown on entering more qty than Mill order qty 2. User should be able to edit and pick the item in the shop order. 3. Shop order satus should be updated to created on clicking save button. 4. Qty picked on mill order should be updated as per the shop order qty"','["url: https://ims.sws.pipe-piling.com/auth/ims/login","mill_admin_user: MIllAdmin","password: obiz","shop_order_user: MillTest","password: obiz","Supplier: S_CAN101_PPMTL","OD-24.000 and Wallt- 0.500 and type SPR.","PO Unit Price- 450 and Price UOM- TON"]','2026-07-31 16:20:10','2026-08-14 14:58:37',1,'P1','["functional", "login"]',1,0),
(38206,NULL,103,1134,5667,'Optimized','RTC_144, RTC_145 & RTC_146 : Verify Shop Order can be created from Spiral Mill Order. Also Verify shop Order edit and approval and Verify Mill Order is updating on shop order creation.','["1. Login as Spiral User.","2. Navigate to Shop Order screen.","3. Click create ship Order and enter Mill Order.","4. Validate all the Mill Order items are displaying.","5. Select Machine # from dropdown and enter shop Order qty for some of the items (Lets say out of 3 only pick 2)","6. Click create shop order.","7. Enter Coil details and Attachment details.","8.  After filling coil details and attachment- click create shop order.","9. Validate shop Order qty is showing updated and approve button is enabled.","10.  Validate shop order report and detail shop order report pdf button is enabled and pdf is printed on clicking on them.","11. Validate coil items and attachment details are being displayed as enter before creation.","12.  Now login with shop order admin user and navigate to shop order screen from the same company and Click approve button and see shop order status on list screen is showing approved"]','1. Item from Mill Order should be populated on adding MO# on shop order along with PO# on the top. 2. User should not be able to create Shop Order without entering coil details and Attchment- Please add the coil details. 3. Shop order should be generated and number should be based on company 4. Shop order details should be displayed on screen. 5. Shop Order should be marked approved.','["","url: https://ims.sws.pipe-piling.com/auth/ims/login","mill_admin_user: MIllAdmin","password: obiz","shop_order_user: MillTest","password: obiz","User- PPMTL with Create PO and PPMTL Mill Order Processing permission","Supplier-S_SPI100_PPMTL","Pipe Size- OD-32.000 and Wallt- 0.375 and type SPR.","Sales Order#","","1. Pipe Number- A001, B001, C001.","2. Coil Grade-CSA G 40.21 - 50 W / A572 GR50","3. CIRC-0.375","4. Inspection- RT, UT"," Coil Items","1. No of Coil-2","2. Coil Weight- 34.40","3. Width- 48.000","4. Thickness-0.375","5. Production Test- Yes.","","Add Attachment","1. Qty, Plates, connector, Cones, Shoes- 1 or 2","2. Edge- Bevel","3. NDT- MPI, UT","4. Pipe End- Bevel"]','2026-07-31 16:20:10','2026-09-09 07:15:55',1,'P1','["functional", "login"]',1,0),
(38207,NULL,103,1134,5670,'Optimized','RTC_147: Verify user can create multiple shop Order of same Mill Order.','["2. Click pick all button and enter the required details.","3. Click create shop order.","4. Validate shop order is created and B/O should be updated to zero.","5. validate Qty picked on MIll order is same as qty order."]','Validate shop order is created and B/O should be updated to zero. validate Qty picked on MIll order is same as qty order.','["url: https://ims.sws.pipe-piling.com/auth/ims/login","mill_admin_user: MIllAdmin","shop_order_user: MillTest","password: obiz","Supplier-S_SPI100_PPMTL",""]','2026-07-31 16:20:10','2026-08-15 09:12:16',1,'P1','["functional", "logout", "smoke"]',0,0),
(38208,NULL,103,1134,5673,'Optimized','RTC_148: Verify shop order cancellation and qty update in Mill Order','["1. Pick the shop order and check the shop order qty","2. Click cancel shop order.","3. Validate shop order status should be marked cancelled & same status should be shown on Shop order list screen","4. Validate qty picked should be reduced as per the shop order qty"]','1. User should be able to cancel the shop order. 2. Qty picked on Mill order should be updated- reduced as per the shop order.','["url: https://ims.sws.pipe-piling.com/auth/ims/login","shop_order_user: MillTest","password: obiz"]','2026-07-31 16:20:10','2026-08-15 17:33:33',1,'P1','["functional", "ui"]',1,0),
(38209,NULL,103,1134,5673,'Optimized','RTC_145: Verify shop Order edit and approval','["1. Select above Shop order and click edit.","2. Pick the item was which was not picked earlier and enter shop order qty- try to pick more then MO qty.","3. Now enter qty less then Mill order.","4. Add Pipe#, Coil grade,CIRC, Inspection type for the newly picked item and click save.","5. Validate shop order status should be updated to created status.","6. Navigate to Mill order screen and open the MIll Order and validate Qty picked should match shop order qty added on shop order."]','1. Validation should be shown on entering more qty than Mill order qty 2. User should be able to edit and pick the item in the shop order. 3. Shop order satus should be updated to created on clicking save button. 4. Qty picked on mill order should be updated as per the shop order qty','["url: https://ims.sws.pipe-piling.com/auth/ims/login","shop_order_user: MillTest","password: obiz"]','2026-07-31 16:20:10','2026-08-16 06:49:46',1,'P2','["functional", "ui"]',1,0),
(38210,NULL,103,1134,5673,'Optimized','RTC_115: Verify PPUSA to PPMTL Order shipment edit with same product code picked in the shipment with receiving location supplier [DO NOT USE]','["1.Login with PPUSA user/Seneca company  and initiate a PPUSA to PPMTL purchase order with supplier- \'S_PPMTL_PPUSA\' and ship to location as - Supplier USA","2. Add pickup location as PPBC and then add 4 different Beams from look up and update their qty and add price 40 with price UOM(Unit)- FT","3. Now login as PPBC user and open the system generated sales order and copy the first product code  and paste under enter product id and click + button to add item in SO and update price to 40 per FT","4. Also add FREIGHT item in the Sales Order with price 200 with UOM EA","5. Navigate to Shipment screen and pick item 1, 2 and generate the pick and BOL.","6. Copy the Shipment id and Now login as PPUSA Seneca user and navigate to Receive Intransit screen and search with Shipment# in BOL field and status Purchase Order Receeived and click search","7. Open the Intransit and check the item should match with SO shipment.","8. Now undo the receipt and then login as PPBC user and navigate to shipment and check Shipment status is updated to BOL In Progress ","9. now edit the shipment and remove item#1 by updating qty as 0 and pick the item#5 and item item#6 and generate the BOL.","10. Validate shipment status is updated to Shipment delivered on Shipment list screen.","11. Now login as Seneca user and validate system generated PO intransiton receive Intransit screen is showing as received and in transit has same items along with the sequence# which are updated in the SO shipment.",""]','1. Item should be updated on Sales oder updated on edit  2. PO intransit should be generated and marked received in PPUSA and should have same items as SO shipment. 3. Undo receipt should work and SO shipmennt should be marked BOL In Progress 4. Edit should should allows user to edit the SO shipment and BOL generated shipment should be updated for SO shipment. 5. System generated  PO Intransit should also be updated with updated items and it should follow the same sequence of items as per SO shipment.','["url: https://ims.sws.pipe-piling.com/auth/ims/login","username: TestA","password: ofbiz",""]','2026-07-31 16:20:11','2026-08-17 07:46:08',1,'P2','["functional", "ui"]',1,0),
(38211,NULL,103,1134,5674,'Optimized','RTC_115: Verify PPUSA to PPMTL Order shipment edit with same product code picked in the shipment with receiving location supplier','["1.Login with PPUSA user/Seneca company  and initiate a PPUSA to PPMTL purchase order with supplier- \'S_PPMTL_PPUSA\' and ship to location as - Supplier USA","2. Add pickup location as PPBC and then add 4 different Beams from look up and update their qty and add price 40 with price UOM(Unit)- FT","3. Now login as PPBC user and open the system generated sales order and copy the first product code  and paste under enter product id and click + button to add item in SO and update price to 40 per FT","4. Also add FREIGHT item in the Sales Order with price 200 with UOM EA","5. Navigate to Shipment screen and pick item 1, 2 and generate the pick and BOL.","6. Copy the Shipment id and Now login as PPUSA Seneca user and navigate to Receive Intransit screen and search with Shipment# in BOL field and status Purchase Order Receeived and click search","7. Open the Intransit and check the item should match with SO shipment.","8. Now undo the receipt and then login as PPBC user and navigate to shipment and check Shipment status is updated to BOL In Progress ","9. now edit the shipment and remove item#1 by updating qty as 0 and pick the item#5 and item item#6 and generate the BOL.","10. Validate shipment status is updated to Shipment delivered on Shipment list screen.","11. Now login as Seneca user and validate system generated PO intransiton receive Intransit screen is showing as received and in transit has same items along with the sequence# which are updated in the SO shipment.",""]','1. Item should be updated on Sales oder updated on edit  2. PO intransit should be generated and marked received in PPUSA and should have same items as SO shipment. 3. Undo receipt should work and SO shipmennt should be marked BOL In Progress 4. Edit should should allows user to edit the SO shipment and BOL generated shipment should be updated for SO shipment. 5. System generated  PO Intransit should also be updated with updated items and it should follow the same sequence of items as per SO shipment.','["url: https://ims.sws.pipe-piling.com/auth/ims/login","username: TestA","password: ofbiz",""]','2026-07-31 16:20:11','2026-08-17 07:48:06',1,'P1','["functional", "UI", "p1"]',1,0),
(38212,NULL,103,1134,5674,'Optimized','RTC_33: Verify user is able to import the xls file to add items in edit Sales Order','["1. Navigate to order screen.","2. Pick any existing order and edit it.","3. Now click import from excel file.","5. Try uploading the xls file in 97-2003 format."]','Item added in xls sheet should append to the sales order grid with the same qty mentioned in the sheet.','["url: https://ims.sws.pipe-piling.com/auth/ims/login","username: TestA","password: ofbiz","",""]','2026-07-31 16:20:11','2026-08-22 13:37:01',1,'P1','["functional", "UI", "p1"]',1,0),
(38213,NULL,103,1134,5674,'Optimized','STC_33: Validate Sales Order with deferred revenue','["1.Open the login URL, enter a valid Username and a valid Password, then click Login.","2. Click on Create New Order","3. Click on search icon beside Enter Product ID","4. Select Product Type as PIPE","5. Click on Search","6. Select first 3 checkbox from the list","7. Click on Add Products","8. Click on search icon beside Enter Product ID","9. Select Product Type as NONSTK","10. Enable Available Toggle","11. Click on Search","12. Check the checkbox where Product ID is MISC","13. Click on Add Products","14. Click on search icon beside Find Bill Address","15. Click on add button on the first item","16. Click on Save","17. Assert: Edit order screen is displayed","18. Read and capture the Order # caption near the Edit Order header","17. Update unit price as 80 for first 3 items on edit order screen","18. Update unit price as 100 for MISC item on edit order sceen","19. Select MISC item and click on Exclude Def checkbox","20. Assert: Exclude Def checkbox is checked","21. Click on Bulk Save button","22. Click on Order Actions button","23. Click on Approve order menu item","24. Click on Order Actions button","25. Click on Add Deferred Revenue menu item","26. Assert: Add Deferred Revenue overlay is displayed","27. Click on Pick All ","28. Read and capture the >>>>Total value near the Rows per page footer","29. Enter the captured Total value in Deferred Revenue pre-tax input field without comma","30. Click on Preview Payment Invoice button","31. Click on Generate payment invoice button on Preview for Invoice screen","32. Click on Actions button","33. Click on Def Revenue Summary menu item","\\"34. Assert: Deferred Revenue Summary page is displayed","\\"","35. Assert: Deffered Revenue (Pre-Tax $) colum have Total value","36. Click on cross icon to close the summary screen","37. Validate deposit status on order edit screen for all the items in the order","38. Assert: MISC item deposit status should be shown N and other items as Y","39. Click on cross icon to close the edit order screen","40. Click on Shipping","41. Enter the captured Order # into the Order # field and click on search","42. Click Edit button","43. Enter Qty to pick as 1 for item 1, 2 only","44. Click on Generate picklist button","45. Click on Generate BOL","46. Read and Capture the BOL # on the manage shipment header","47. Click on cross icon to close the manage shipment screen","48. Click on Shipment To Invoice screen","49. Enter the captured BOL # into the BOL # field and click on search","50. Select the checkbox and click on generate invoice button","51. Click on Preview Invoice","52. Click on Ok button on confirm popup","53. Click on Generate Invoice button","54. Click on invoices screen","55. Enter the captured BOL # into BOL # field and Click on Search","56. Click on edit","57. Assert: sub total should be 0.00 dollar and deposit row should be added in Invoice","58. Click on Shipping menu","59. Enter the captured BOL # into the BOL# field and click on search","60. Click on edit button","61. Click on New","62. Enter Qty to pick as 1 for item 3, 4 only","63. Click on Generate picklist button","64. Click on Generate BOL","65. Read and capture the BOL #  on the manage shipment header","66. Click on cross icon to close the manage shipment screen","67. Click on Shipment To Invoice menu","68. Enter the capured BOL # into BOL # field and click on search","69. Select the checkbox and click on generate invoice button","70. Click on Preview Invoice","71. Click on Ok button on confirm popup","72. Click on Generate Invoice button","73. Click on invoices screen","74. Enter the captured BOL # into BOL # field and click on Search","75. Click on edit button","76. Assert: \'Deposit row should be added in Invoice and subtotal should be for the MISC item","77. Click on cross icon to close the Manage invoice screen","78. Click on  order menu to open search order page","79. Enter captured Order # into the Order # field and select the order status as completed","80. Click on Search","81. Click on Edit button","82. Click on Actions button","83. Click on Def Revenue Summary ","84. Validate deferred revenue summary on the sales order edit"]','User should be able to login in the application and Search Orders screen is displayed New Sales Order screen should display Lookup Product screen should be displayed Find Party overlay should display Sales Order should be created Checkbox for Exclude Def should be shown selected after bulk save for MISC item Add Deferred Revenue screen should be displayed Deferred revenue preview screen should be displayed Deferred Revenue Summary should be displayed with total amount MISC item deposit status should be shown N and other items as Y Manage shipment screen should be displayed Preview For Invoice screen should displayed sub total should be 0.00 dollar and deposit row should be added in Invoice Manage shipment screen should be displayed Preview For Invoice screen should displayed Deposit row should be added in Invoice and subtotal should be for the MISC item One item should be displayed with Order # Deferred Revenue Summary screen should be displayed Deferred Revenue Summary screen should be displayed with shipment details','["url: https://ims.sws.pipe-piling.com/auth/ims/login","username: TestA","password: ofbiz"]','2026-07-31 16:20:11','2026-08-23 08:45:59',1,'P2','["functional", "UI", "p2"]',0,0),
